TFC Horizon — Horizon-native workshop mod (TerraFirmaCraft-inspired survival).

Inspired by TerraFirmaCraft (https://github.com/TerraFirmaCraft/TerraFirmaCraft);
not affiliated with the TerraFirmaCraft authors. Clean reimplementation for
Horizon — not a jar port and not TerraFirmaGreg.

Reference design target: TFC for Minecraft Java 1.20.1 (as used in TFG-Modern).

Original Rust, JSON, and generated tables in this folder: MIT unless noted.
Minecraft / Mojang assets are not redistributed.
TFC textures are not copied; blocks/items use vanilla templates until original
or licensed art is added.
